Next term is 3x. Substituting x with -2, that becomes 3 times (-2). 3 times -2 is -6. Got that.

Third term is just 4, so that stays as 4.

Now, adding all those terms together: 8 (from the first term) plus (-6) (from the second term) plus 4 (third term). 

