#### Term 2:
$$
\frac{\sqrt{3456}}{9} = \frac{\sqrt{144 \cdot 24}}{9} = \frac{\sqrt{144} \cdot \sqrt{24}}{9} = \frac{12 \cdot 2\sqrt{6}}{9} = \frac{24\sqrt{6}}{9} = \frac{8\sqrt{6}}{3}
$$

#### Term 3:
$$
\sqrt{6} = \sqrt{6}
$$

---

